%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#334155", "noteBkgColor": "#f8fafc", "noteBorderColor": "#94a3b8"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor B as Member A (browser)
  box rgb(219,234,254) Purchase
    participant P as Purchase :8001
    participant PDB as Purchase DB
  end
  box rgb(220,252,231) Payment
    participant PAY as Payment :8002
  end
  box rgb(254,243,199) Access
    participant AXS as Access :8003
  end
  Note over B,PAY: 10:05 BK-7KQ2M9 is held until 10:15, session ps_... open until 10:13, THB 450.00
  B->>P: GET /bookings/BK-7KQ2M9/cancel
  P->>PAY: GET /payment-sessions/ps_... (the confirm screen reconciles first, PUR-R24)
  PAY-->>P: 200 {"status": "open", "payment_status": "unpaid"}
  P-->>B: 200 confirm screen: "We have not received a payment for this booking. Cancelling closes the payment page.<br/>If a payment completes first, the refund is THB 450.00 (100%)." (PUR-R31, PUR-R30)
  Note over B,P: Had the read found paid, the booking would be confirmed now and the screen would show "Refund THB 450.00 (100%)"
  B->>P: POST /bookings/BK-7KQ2M9/cancel shown_refund_satang=45000
  Note over P: The PUR-R30 amount is still 45000, so the check passes#59; it runs before any Payment call (PUR-R30)
  P->>PAY: POST /payment-sessions/ps_.../expire, Bearer PAYMENT_API_TOKEN (PUR-R31)
  Note over PAY: The expire and any Pay lock the same session row: exactly one wins (PMT-R06)
  alt Payment unreachable
    PAY--xP: no answer (timeout=5)
    P-->>B: 303 to /bookings/BK-7KQ2M9, flash "Payment is not reachable. Please try again.", nothing changes (PUR-R31)
  else unpaid, inside the hold (the usual case)
    PAY-->>P: 200 {"status": "expired", "payment_status": "unpaid"}
    P->>PDB: held to cancelled, cancel_reason member_cancel, no refund (PUR-R28)
    P-->>B: 303 to /bookings/BK-7KQ2M9, flash "Booking cancelled", no refund
  else unpaid, hold already lapsed (now at or after 10:15)
    PAY-->>P: 200 {"status": "expired", "payment_status": "unpaid"}
    P->>PDB: held to expired, not cancelled (PUR-R31, PUR-R24)
    P-->>B: 303 to /bookings/BK-7KQ2M9, flash "This hold has already expired"
  else paid in another tab between the screen and the expire
    PAY-->>P: 200 {"status": "complete", "payment_status": "paid", "amount_satang": 45000}
    P->>PDB: BEGIN, held to confirmed without issuing a grant, COMMIT (PUR-R31, PUR-R25)
    Note over P: Continue as a confirmed-booking cancel: 2026-10-05 10:05 is about 47 h before start, 100% (PUR-R30)
    P->>PDB: BEGIN, confirmed to cancelled, refund_amount_satang 45000, member_cancel, COMMIT (PUR-R32)
    P->>AXS: POST /grants/BK-7KQ2M9/revoke, Bearer ACCESS_API_TOKEN
    AXS-->>P: 200 {"status": "revoked"} revoked tombstone, no grant ever issued (AXS-R02, AXS-R17)
    P->>PAY: POST /refunds {"payment_session_id": "ps_...", "booking_reference": "BK-7KQ2M9", "amount_satang": 45000, "reason": "member_cancel", "attempt": 1}
    PAY-->>P: 201 {"id": "re_...", "status": "succeeded"} (PMT-R14, PMT-R15)
    P->>PDB: grant_status revoked, refund_status succeeded, refund_attempt 1
    P-->>B: 303 to /bookings/BK-7KQ2M9, flash "Booking cancelled", refund THB 450.00 (100%)
  end
